Original SillyTavern extension:
https://github.com/cata02222/SillyTavern-Microfiche

This repository is a Lumiverse Spindle port of that program. It is not
published by the original author. The rendering, layout, exemption, and
archive-planning files under vendor/microfiche/lib/ are copied from that
project so the pages stay the same. The copied Spleen table stores empty
bitmaps for Latin-1; src/latin1-glyphs.ts fills only those empty slots at
runtime. The vendor font file is not modified.

The Spleen 5×8 bitmap font is Copyright (c) 2018-2026 Frederic Cambus and
is used under the BSD 2-Clause license in licenses/LICENSE-spleen.

